5,0,1,talk,Midori,,"Hello everyone. Let's all try our best to find the werewolf together, shall we?","{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,0,1,talk,Rin,,This is so exciting! I'm going to find the bad guy first!,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
