13,0,2,talk,Shion,,Fun is secondary to winning. I'll be watching everyone's reactions closely.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
14,0,2,talk,Benjamin,,Indeed. The contrast between the children's energy and Shion's coldness is quite amusing.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Shion""],""raw_differs"":false}"
15,0,3,talk,Midori,,"Does anyone have any initial theories, or is it too early?","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
