18,0,3,talk,Shion,,"That's a leap in logic, Sakura. Being quiet isn't a crime.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,0,3,talk,Benjamin,,"A common trope, but hardly a proof. We have no data yet.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
