49,1,3,talk,Shion,,The evidence provided by the Seer is the most concrete lead we have.,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,1,3,talk,Benjamin,,"Logically, if we trust Midori, the choice is simple.","{""words"":9,""mentions"":[""Midori""],""raw_differs"":false}"
